		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>15-foot diameter, perfectly round indigo sphere that pulsates with blue tendrils of energy. Highly magnetic.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 45, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tentacle +6 (3d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to electricity and fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Magnetic</strong>. Attacks on ooze with weapons made of ferrous metals (iron, steel, adamantine, etc.) have DISADV. Creatures wearing ferrous metals within near of ooze, STR 15+ on turn or else move towards ooze, stuck fast, cannot move away.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
